# Step 21.9 (a), declaration arguments (book #declaration-arguments), row A07: refusal (answer 5): a named actual off its position turns the counter off; an unnamed actual after it is refused
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: calls 0
)
fn: h (int: x 3; int: y 6) int
    return: x * 10 + y
sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\seen := h(y := 4; 5)
main()
